==Trivia==
*Iz the Dancer is a reference to ''[[wikipedia:The Dancing Girl of Izu|The Dancing Girl of Izu]]'' or ''The Izu Dancer'', a short story by [[wikipedia:Yasunari Kawabata|Yasunari Kawabata]].
**In Japanese, her name is read as ''Izu''; it would seem the change to ''Iz'' was a mistranslation.
*Appearance-wise, Iz the Dancer is best described as a feline version of [[wikia:hakushon-daimao:Akubi|Akubi]] from the anime ''[[wikipedia:The Genie Family|Hakushon Daimaō]]'', also known as ''The Genie Family''.
*Unlike many other [[UBERFEST (Gacha Event)|UBERFEST]] units but similar to EPICFEST ones, Iz doesn't have a "young" version as her first form, with vastly different roles and stats, instead having both forms share the same cost and recharge time, with the Evolved Form being a direct improvement.
*Prior to [[Version 14.1 Update|Version 14.1]], her Evolved Form's English description erroneously described her ability as Insane Damage rather than Massive Damage.

